WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.469
How far our radio has got.

00:03.169 --> 00:12.991
The sphere marks how far radio from the Earth can have travelled since Marconi's signal crossed the Atlantic on 12 December 1901.

00:13.441 --> 00:16.096
It grows by one light-year a year.

00:16.546 --> 00:19.757
Out here the signal is far too faint to pick up.

00:20.207 --> 00:23.864
Everything humans have ever broadcast is inside it.
